{
  "uid": "platzwart-protokolle",
  "title": "Protokolle",
  "description": "Die Ausgaben aller Container, durchsuchbar. Quelle: Loki (Schalter 'Protokolle sammeln').",
  "tags": [
    "platzwart"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "editable": true,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "stack",
        "label": "Server",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "platzwart-loki"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values({job=\"platzwart\"}, stack)",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        "definition": "label_values({job=\"platzwart\"}, stack)",
        "sort": 1,
        "options": [],
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Woher die Zeilen kommen",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Diese Seite braucht den Schalter **Protokolle sammeln** unter *Module*. `platzwart-protokolle` folgt auf der Maschine den Ausgaben aller Container, **schwärzt bekannte Passwortmuster** und schiebt die Zeilen nach Loki — ohne Docker-Socket in einem Container.\n\n*Needs the log switch; the shipper follows every container's output on the host, redacts known password patterns and pushes to Loki — no Docker socket in a container.*"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Menge und Auffaelliges",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Zeilen je Sekunde",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "platzwart-loki"
      },
      "description": "Ein Server, der ploetzlich zehnmal so viel schreibt, hat ein Problem - oft bevor er ausfaellt.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 18,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            },
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "platzwart-loki"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (stack) (rate({job=\"platzwart\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{stack}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": false,
          "queryType": "range",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Auffaellige Zeilen (1 h)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "platzwart-loki"
      },
      "description": "Fehler, Ausnahmen, Abstuerze - ein grober Filter, bewusst ohne Anspruch auf Vollstaendigkeit.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 50
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "platzwart-loki"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"platzwart\"} |~ `(?i)error|exception|fatal|panic` [1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "Treffer",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": false,
          "queryType": "range",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
